<title>USA: Cool weather seen in Brazil coffee areas on Sunday.</title>
<headline>Cool weather seen in Brazil coffee areas on Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooling temperatures to between below and well below normal levels are forecast for Brazil's coffee growing areas over the coming weekend but no damaging cold is expected, forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Cloudy weather with scattered showers and thunderstorms were forecast for Thursday, clearing on Friday with lingering light showers.</p>
<p>Temperatures were seen near to below normal but they were expected to fall to 39-46F on Sunday and Monday mornings and the situation bore watching, it said.</p>
